  "description": "Woojoo's parents have always been a little kooky, but this time they've clearly outdone themselves!\nWhen Woojoo begrudgingly comes back home after running away for the Nth time, he finds out he has a fiance. Lucky for Woojoo, he now has to share his room with the guy - a fairytale prince, yes, but a straight one. \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
